Add saffron.await_exec

Repeated `write_stdin` polling consumes model turns while an external
command is idle.

Add an event-driven `saffron.await_exec` tool with explicit wait modes
for output, process exit, and timeout. Extend unified exec with
cancellation-safe serialized interactions so the waiter cannot race
`write_stdin` or steal buffered output, while the existing process
manager retains session lifecycle and output ownership.

Cover output wakeups, early exit detection, exit-only waits, timeout
reuse, and the model-visible tool boundary.
